าง","hasImage":false,"hint":null,"topics":["2"],"subTopics":["2.10"],"correct":0,"choices":["$\\forall x[x^2\\ne 5]$","$\\exists x[x^2=5]$","$\\forall x[x^2-x\\ne 0]$","$\\exists x[x^2+1=0]$"],"question":"ให้ $U=\\{-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3\\}$ ข้อใดต่อไปนี้เป็นจริง"},{"id":"gen-chap-02-logic-q293","type":"mc","difficulty":"ปานกลาง","hasImage":false,"hint":null,"topics":["2"],"subTopics":["2.11","2.10","3.6"],"correct":0,"choices":["$\\exists x[x\\le 0]$","$\\forall x[x\\le 0]$","$\\forall x[x>0]$","$\\forall x[x<0]$"],"question":"ให้เอกภพ $U=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{Z}: x^2-2x-3\\le 0\\}$ ประโยค $\\forall x[x>0]$ เป็นเท็จ ข้อใดคือนิเสธของประโยคนี้ที่มีค่าความจริงเป็นจริง"},{"id":"gen-chap-02-logic-q295","type":"mc","difficulty":"ยาก","hasImage":false,"hint":null,"topics":["2"],"subTopics":["2.12","2.10"],"correct":2,"choices":["$\\forall x\\,\\exists y[y>x]$","$\\forall y\\,\\exists x[x^2\\ge y]$","$\\exists y\\,\\forall x[x\\ge y]$","$\\exists x\\,\\forall y[x\\le y^2]$"],"question":"บนเอกภพจำนวนจริง $\\mathbb{R}$ ข้อใดต่อไปนี้เป็น<u>เท็จ</u>"},{"id":"gen-chap-02-logic-q296","type":"mc","difficulty":"ยาก","hasImage":false,"hint":null,"topics":["2"],"subTopics":["2.11","2.12","2.10"],"correct":0,"choices":["$\\exists x\\,\\forall y[xy\\ne 1]$","$\\forall x\\,\\exists y[xy\\ne 1]$","$\\exists x\\,\\exists y[xy\\ne 1]$","$\\forall x\\,\\forall y[xy\\ne 1]$"],"question":"บนเอกภพจำนวนจริง $\\mathbb{R}$ ให้ $S$ คือประโยค $\\forall x\\,\\exists y[xy=1]$ ข้อใดคือนิเสธของ $S$ ที่เขียนถูกต้อง"},{"id":"gen-chap-02-logic-q298","type":"mc","difficulty":"ยาก","hasImage":false,"hint":null,"topics":["2"],"subTopics":["2.10","3.3"],"correct":0,"choices":["$\\forall x[x^2\\le 2x]$","$\\exists x[x^2=3]$","$\\forall x[x>0]$","$\\exists x[x^2=5]$"],"question":"ให้เอกภพ $U=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{Z}: x^3-3x^2+2x=0\\}$ ข้อใดต่อไปนี้เป็นจริง"},{"id":"gen-chap-02-logic-q299","type":"mc","difficulty":"ยากมาก","hasImage":false,"hint":null,"topics":["2"],"subTopics":["2.10","3.4"],"correct":0,"choices":["$\\forall 